@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram for Digital Watch

state StartChoice <<choice>>
state TimeSettingChoice <<choice>>
state AlarmSettingChoice <<choice>>
state LightControlChoice <<choice>>

StartChoice --> TimeSettingChoice : View/Adjust time
TimeSettingChoice --> HourChange : Press button
HourChange --> MinuteChange : Press button
MinuteChange --> AlarmHourChange : Press button
AlarmHourChange --> AlarmMinuteChange : Press button
AlarmMinuteChange --> AlarmOnOff : Press button
AlarmOnOff --> AlarmTrigger : Set alarm time matches current time
AlarmOnOff --> StopAlarm : Press stop alarm button
StopAlarm --> LightControlChoice : Press light control button
LightControlChoice --> LightOn : Press button
LightOn --> LightOff : Release button

@enduml
